---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Show the saved login, the account and each workspace with its board and folder count.
Counts come from one request per workspace; --with adds the tokens.

USAGE
  holst auth status [flags]

FLAGS
  --with parts   Also show these parts, comma separated: tokens; none by default

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst auth status
  $ holst auth status --with tokens -o json

LEARN MORE
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
